WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Hi, I'm Jack and today I want to share with you my experience with Shuri, an incredible

00:06.000 --> 00:11.880
coach who helped me navigate through some of the hardest time in my life.

00:11.880 --> 00:18.440
As an actor my life can be pretty hectic, the pressure, the hunting for roles, auditions,

00:18.440 --> 00:21.280
I was struggling with anxiety.

00:21.280 --> 00:24.120
That's when I turned to Shuri.

00:24.120 --> 00:30.400
What surprised me the most was how quickly they helped me to find clarity and peace.

00:30.400 --> 00:37.040
It was not just coping methods, it was truly understanding and overcoming all my insides,

00:37.040 --> 00:39.080
all my past traumas.

00:39.080 --> 00:47.480
Their approach was personalized, compassionate and most important, effective.

00:47.480 --> 00:53.520
Today I feel more in control, more resilient and I finally enjoy my actor life, my career.

00:53.520 --> 00:56.040
I'm really, really grateful to Shuri.

00:56.040 --> 01:02.520
So if you are facing challenges like this one, I can't recommend them enough.

01:02.520 --> 01:08.560
So thank you Shuri, you helped me to turn a new page of my life.

01:08.560 --> 01:10.360
You have been a game changer.

